A page is often too coarse for retrieval. Split pages further so relevant passages are not diluted by
surrounding text. @[ RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter ] recursively splits on common separators (such
as newlines) until each chunk is the target size. This is the recommended text splitter for generic
text use cases.
