Use retrievers
LangChain @[ VectorStore ] objects do not subclass @[ Runnable ]. @[Retrievers] are Runnables, so
they support standard methods such as sync and async invoke and batch .
You can also build retrievers from vector stores, and retrievers can also wrap non-vector sources
(such as external APIs).
