Zod is a library for validating and parsing pre-defined schemas. You can use it to
define the input schema for your tools to make sure the agent only calls the tool
with the correct arguments.
Alternatively, you can define the schema property as a JSON schema object. Keep
in mind that JSON schemas won't be validated at runtime.
