Configuration options
Tools to defer behind the provider's tool search, given by name or instance. Deferred
tools are withheld from the model until its search surfaces them. Tools constructed
with extras.defer_loading: true are deferred regardless of this option; if
searchableTools is omitted, only those pre-marked tools are deferred.
