9. Advanced: Stateful routers
The router we've built so far is stateless (each request is handled independently with no
memory between calls). For multi-turn conversations, you need a stateful approach.
Tool wrapper approach
The simplest way to add conversation memory is to wrap the stateless router as a tool that a
conversational agent can call:
