Example: unnamed channel
Without a name, the channel is a side-channel projection only — accessible on stream.extensions
but not visible to consumers iterating raw events. This is the right choice for projections that hold
in-process handles (promises, async iterables, class instances) that can't be serialized onto the main
event stream.
