Partial execution
For agents made up of larger graphs, you may wish to test partial execution paths within your agent
rather than the entire flow end-to-end. In some cases, it may make semantic sense to restructure
these sections as subgraphs, which you can invoke in isolation as normal.
However, if you do not wish to make changes to your agent graph's overall structure, you can use

