ToolNode
@[ ToolNode ] is a prebuilt node that executes tools in LangGraph workflows. It handles parallel tool
execution, error handling, and state injection automatically.
Use @[ ToolNode ] when you need fine-grained control over how your graph executes tools. This is
the building block that powers tool execution in many LangGraph agent patterns.
python
