Subscriptions
Clients subscribe to change notifications for specific resources by sending a subscriptions/listen
request with the resource URIs listed in notifications.resourceSubscriptions . The server delivers
notifications/resources/updated on the resulting stream whenever a watched resource changes.
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
