  "params": {
    "_meta": { "io.modelcontextprotocol/subscriptionId": 4 },
    "uri": "file:///project/src/main.rs"
  }
}

Tools
input, not connection state.
Servers SHOULD return tools in a deterministic order (i.e., the same ordering across requests when
the underlying set of tools has not changed). Deterministic ordering enables clients to reliably
cache the tool list and improves LLM prompt cache hit rates when tools are included in model
context.
